description=Telegram bot for rooted Android (ZTE F50). 12-language UI. Cep çakısı features: cell-tools integration (/spectrum, /imsi_watch, /locate via BeaconDB), sms-cmd management (/sms_cmd offline SMS backup channel). + status/AT/shell/perf/IMEI/SMS/wifi/network/power/scheduling/tailscale/speedtest/update/install_module/sha256 verify. Requires bin-utils v1.3.0+.
